{"municipality_code":"11242","pref":"埼玉県","city":"日高市","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"日高市には、横手村、久保村、台村など、近世の村々の記憶を伝える地名が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、史跡や遺跡にまつわる場所が点在し、「向山遺跡」、「姥原遺跡」、「高岡廃寺」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板に加え、横手村や久保村にゆかりのある旧境石標、村の歴史を紹介する案内板にも注目してみてください。 ゆかりの人物では駒野昇や高萩万次郎に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「巾着田」や「聖天院勝楽寺」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":9,"rank":1372,"percentile":26.6,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":17,"rank":752,"percentile":59.6,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":16,"rank":1365,"percentile":25.8,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":7,"rank":1128,"percentile":34.2,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":3,"rank":1013,"percentile":37.8,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":2,"rank":1236,"percentile":23.9,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":29,"rank":621,"percentile":66.4,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":["駒野昇","高萩万次郎","高林謙三","加藤与之吉"],"tourism_landmarks"